<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Congratulations!&nbsp;</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">By registering for Flywire's <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-insights-summit-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=" data-mce-selected="inline-boundary"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>International Insights Summit 2025</u></strong></span></a>, you get access to exclusive data insights and the definitive market intelligence you need to inform your strategies, address the risk and take advantage of the opportunities presented by the continual and rapid evolution of the international education landscape. We're thrilled to have you join us!</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Our unmissable <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-insights-summit-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>agenda</u></strong></span></a> will explore the complexities of the international student journey in the context of an evolving education ecosystem. You’ll be the first to get early insights from our Admissions Navigator research, discover what Flywire’s current payment data shows in terms of student mobility trends and behaviours (years ahead of officially published sources), and network with peers in the HE sector to hear about their experiences, success stories and learning points.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-2olp7jlzrkp0a" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/h5t3lcqbfx/en_us/images/68e61f381df9c-1759911736.1228.png" alt="The average increase in UK deposit payments is 22%" title="22 increase" class="st-hide-mobile st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> 
<!--[if !mso 12]><!--> 
<div class="show-img-mobile st-dynamic-2olp7jlzrkp0a" style="display: none; width: 0px; overflow: hidden;">
<img src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/h5t3lcqbfx/en_us/images/68e621d371ec8-1759912403.4666.png" border="0" width="560" valign="top" alt="The average increase in UK deposit payments is 22%" title="22 increase" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="display: block; border: none; max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 560px;" />
