<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">To give you a sneak peak of the insights you can expect, we can reveal that our current payment data shows that the <strong>average deposit payment value has increased, on average, by 22% since 2024</strong>. We’re also seeing a shift in the timing of tuition fee payments, signalling that income collection policies across the sector are evolving.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">We've got more exclusive insights waiting for you. We're really looking forward to seeing you!&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><em><strong>The Flywire Team</strong></em></p> </td> 
</tr> 
