</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Collaboration is the key to success in this area, so please do extend an invitation to your colleagues in other teams—whether Admissions, Finance, the International office or Recruitment—and encourage them to explore the <a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-insights-summit-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>agenda and register</u></strong></span></a> too.</p> </td> 
